  "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-02T02:42:11.617948Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-02T03:47:24.096768Z",
  "totalBlocks": 20,
  "translatedBlocks": 20,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a68dc4cefc9585aa",
      "translationZh": "我们在实验室里使用了一台 Dell B300 几周，并用它为 Qwen Flash Next 创建了两个微调版本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ee5450122ca59b4",
      "translationZh": "Victoria（编程与智能体）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c439e6bb47d3abc6",
      "translationZh": "使用一种名为 REAP 的论文/技术，将 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 削减了 44%：每层从 512 降至 288。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eab0287f08f4c475",
      "translationZh": "随后以 4-bit (NVFP4) 进行重新训练，因此它是针对其交付格式进行训练的，而不仅仅是在事后进行量化。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dee095e9b651e701",
      "translationZh": "Terminal-Bench 2.1：70.0%，这是在每个任务 8 小时超时限制下，3 次运行的平均值。我们之前的 NVFP4 版本得分为 62.5%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "be530fc167b16bcd",
      "translationZh": "48.0 GiB 的权重，包括草稿头（draft head）。95.4 GiB 的 n-gram 表是独立的，不计入该数值中。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3bac88b3d2a106e9",
      "translationZh": "在单台 B300 上使用草稿头时，单流速度为 280 tok/s，而不使用草稿头时为 135 tok/s。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "00bc6ea263594300",
      "translationZh": "GGUF Q4_K_M 为 49.17 GiB。它在 Terminal-Bench 上得分为 75.3%（单次运行，因此视为有噪声），在 HumanEval 上得分为 93.2%（5 次运行的平均值）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1fb99fd7edb02f9d",
      "translationZh": "比我们的上一版本少使用 35% 的输出令牌。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbfb01532d9976d0",
      "translationZh": "枫树（加拿大相关问题）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a51e4dee610ce64",
      "translationZh": "大多数模型在回答有关税收、福利和法规的问题时，会假设你居住在美国。Maple 经过微调，默认针对加拿大。在 600 个保留测试问题中，结合搜索功能：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "311b3e8448c986f1",
      "translationZh": "引用加拿大官方来源：微调前为 6.0%，微调后为 62.9%。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f5d84c9f4d62d18e",
      "translationZh": "完全正确的答案：之前为 6.6%，之后为 21.8%。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e60040581e0e25c8",
      "translationZh": "“无答案”回复：之前为 47.2%，之后为 23.7%。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9db53f47ef061b1d",
      "translationZh": "它使得加拿大在那些声称自己居住在其他地方的人中出现的频率更低：之前为 2.9%，之后为 1.0%。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8010766466cdc76a",
      "translationZh": "编程能力表现稳健：在 HumanEval 上得分为 157/164。评分由 AI 评审小组完成，目前尚未进行人工复核。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d5748fe963977de",
      "translationZh": "链接：https://huggingface.co/rmonsurate/Victoria https://huggingface.co/rmonsurate/Maple",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6cfd6832ca18b72d",
      "translationZh": "很高兴回答关于运行它们的问题。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7540a2bb8b55321d",
      "translationZh": "编辑注：llama.cpp 用户请注意。GGUF 文件包含我们的草稿头（draft head），但主线 llama.cpp 尚不支持该功能，因此会报错“expected 1256, got 1224”。您的下载文件没有问题。目前请从我们的分支构建：github.com/rmonsurate/llama.cpp，分支名为 qwen4exp-mtp。预编译二进制文件即将发布。感谢指出此问题的读者。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7be79f9dcef1a629",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/rmonsurate 提交",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    }
  ],
